{"id":"n70880-1-9","stage":3,"title":"정식 · 正式","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70880-1-9-1","ko":"정식으로 인사드리겠습니다. 처음 뵙겠습니다. 김민준이라고 합니다.","zh":"让我正式跟您打个招呼。初次见面，我叫金敏俊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정식으로","meaning":"正式","explanation":"정식：正式；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"정식","audio":"/audio/341be550a06a33cb8c8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70880","senseId":"1","lemma":"정식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정식으로","audio":"/audio/74dfbc24427735583fa2.mp3"}},{"text":"인사드리겠습니다.","meaning":"问候，打招呼；向尊敬的人表达问候、请求、感谢或告知","explanation":"인사：问候，打招呼；드리다：向尊敬的人表达问候、请求、感谢或告知；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"인사","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66311","senseId":"1","lemma":"인사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"2","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인사드리겠습니다","audio":"/audio/e7d202ce73a12b7e663c.mp3"}},{"text":"처음","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}},{"text":"뵙겠습니다.","meaning":"拜见","explanation":"뵙다：拜见；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"뵙다","audio":"/audio/3c13f85c4383e3b7b8c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62815","senseId":"1","lemma":"뵙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뵙겠습니다","audio":"/audio/5e389adbc770413db821.mp3"}},{"text":"김민준이라고","meaning":"金敏俊","explanation":"김민준：金敏俊；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"김민준이라고","audio":"/audio/9155d9ef1cefb2f8c104.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김민준이라고","audio":"/audio/9155d9ef1cefb2f8c104.mp3"}},{"text":"합니다.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"합니다","audio":"/audio/ba3bd059cedb445814a5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"341be550a06a33cb","term":"정식","zh":"正式","audio":"/audio/341be550a06a33cb8c8a.mp3","entryId":"70880","definition":"符合程序的正确的格式或仪式。","pronunciation":["정ː식"]},{"id":"ae353e9482abc103","term":"인사","zh":"问候，打招呼","audio":"/audio/ae353e9482abc103f0f3.mp3","entryId":"66311","definition":"问候，打招呼","pronunciation":["인사"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"向尊敬的人表达问候、请求、感谢或告知","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"向尊敬的人表达问候、请求、感谢或告知","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"3c13f85c4383e3b7","term":"뵙다","zh":"拜见","audio":"/audio/3c13f85c4383e3b7b8c6.mp3","entryId":"62815","definition":"与长辈见面。","pronunciation":["뵙ː따","뷉ː따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d74f69af0bbe5a28e616.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70880-1-9-2","ko":"반갑습니다. 앞으로 같이 즐겁게 일해 봅시다.","zh":"很高兴认识您。今后让我们一起愉快地共事吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"반갑습니다.","meaning":"高兴，开心，喜悦","explanation":"반갑다：高兴，开心，喜悦；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"반갑다","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70861","senseId":"1","lemma":"반갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반갑습니다","audio":"/audio/0258ef96e9ab46cada62.mp3"}},{"text":"앞으로","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞으로","audio":"/audio/cb4897c6b6949e02da6d.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"즐겁게","meaning":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","explanation":"즐겁다：愉快，欢乐，欢快；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"즐겁다","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62101","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐겁게","audio":"/audio/e99655b0371aabd53eb2.mp3"}},{"text":"일해","meaning":"工作","explanation":"일하다：工作；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"일하다","audio":"/audio/3313fc8f7aeacdfbc30f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57309","senseId":"2","lemma":"일하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일해","audio":"/audio/1931ac6ee4bfc0e1569b.mp3"}},{"text":"봅시다.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봅시다","audio":"/audio/5d12c5167c7da80d3dd8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d5cacddd111bc906","term":"반갑다","zh":"高兴，开心，喜悦","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3","entryId":"70861","definition":"因见到想见的人或实现了愿望而感到欢喜愉快。","pronunciation":["반갑따"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"71ab7f4d89daedab","term":"즐겁다","zh":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3","entryId":"62101","definition":"内心满意、满足且快乐。","pronunciation":["즐겁따"]},{"id":"3313fc8f7aeacdfb","term":"일하다","zh":"工作","audio":"/audio/3313fc8f7aeacdfbc30f.mp3","entryId":"57309","definition":"以某种职业或资格进行活动，或在某个职位上活动。","pronunciation":["일ː하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b9ab75e3b18781352f9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.053,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70880","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7783,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["很高兴认识您。今后让我们一起愉快地共事吧。","让我正式跟您打个招呼。初次见面，我叫金敏俊。","观众的反馈似乎不太好呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["让我正式跟您打个招呼。初次见面，我叫金敏俊。","观众的反馈似乎不太好呢？","很高兴认识您。今后让我们一起愉快地共事吧。"],"answer":2}]}
